---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
const title = 'Wellner Academy Portfolio | Adsbangda';
const description = 'Wellner Academy portfolio: Social Media Management strategy for educational content on finance, tax, accounting, and design.';
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} path="en/portofolio-wellner-academy.html" lang="id" lang="en" hreflangId="portofolio-wellner-academy.html" portfolioCss={true} ogImageAlt="Wellner Academy portfolio by Adsbangda" ogImage="assets/img/img-js-8874da302d43.webp" ogImageWidth={700} ogImageHeight={481}>
{ /* head-style slot: CSS khusus halaman ini (kalau ada) */ }
<Fragment slot="head-style">
<style>
/* ---------- SERVICES ---------- */
.section{padding:80px 0;}

.section-head{margin-bottom:32px;}

.cd-summary{font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#3b3d3a;margin:0 0 20px;text-align:justify;}

.cd-summary:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}

.project-block .mp-thumb img{width:100%;display:block;}

/* ---- case study: tools & software ---- */
.tools-grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start;gap:40px 64px;margin-top:0;}

.tools-icon-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;gap:20px;}

.tool-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;width:64px;flex-shrink:0;text-align:left;min-width:0;}
</style>
</Fragment>



<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="portofolio.html" class="back-link reveal" data-i18n="back_link" style="margin-bottom:22px;display:inline-flex;">&larr; Back to Portfolio</a>
    <h1>Wellner Academy</h1>
    <p data-i18n="hero_h2" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-top:18px;line-height:1.5;">Building Wellner Academy's Digital Presence Through Consistent Educational Content</p>
    <p class="cd-summary" data-i18n="hero_lede1" style="margin:20px 0 0;">Adsbangda helped Wellner Academy build its digital presence through a Social Media Management strategy focused on delivering educational, relevant, and consistent content.</p>
    <p class="cd-summary" data-i18n="hero_lede2" style="margin:20px 0 0;">Throughout the collaboration, we were responsible for content planning, visual design, copywriting, and regular publishing to build brand credibility, boost engagement, and expand audience reach on social media.</p>

    <div class="hero-meta reveal">
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <div class="overview-icon" style="background:rgba(244,228,9,.25);">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3.5l8 4.3-8 4.3-8-4.3 8-4.3z" stroke="#8a7c00" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M4 12.2l8 4.3 8-4.3" stroke="#8a7c00" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M4 16.5l8 4.3 8-4.3" stroke="#8a7c00" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-text">
          <span data-i18n="ov_k3">Services</span>
          <b data-i18n="ov_v3">Social Media Management</b>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <div class="overview-icon" style="background:rgba(255,74,61,.12);">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/><rect x="13.5" y="3.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/><rect x="3.5" y="13.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/><rect x="13.5" y="13.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-text">
          <span data-i18n="ov_k4">Platform</span>
          <b data-i18n="ov_v4">Instagram, TikTok</b>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <div class="overview-icon" style="background:rgba(27,75,67,.12);">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M20.5 13.2L13 20.7a1.6 1.6 0 0 1-2.3 0l-7.2-7.2V4.3h9.2l7.2 7.2a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 .6 1.7z" stroke="#1B4B43" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="8.3" cy="8.3" r="1.4" fill="#1B4B43"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-text">
          <span data-i18n="ov_k5">Category</span>
          <b data-i18n="ov_v5">Social Media Management</b>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cd-wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <h2 data-i18n="about_label">About The Project</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="about_p1">Wellner Academy is an education platform presenting materials on finance, taxation, accounting, and creative design to help the public and professionals improve their skills.</p>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="about_p2">To support the brand's growth on social media, Wellner Academy trusted Adsbangda as its creative partner to manage the content strategy end-to-end. We ensure every piece of content is produced consistently with an engaging visual approach, easy-to-understand information, and relevance to audience needs.</p>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="about_p3">Through this strategy, Wellner Academy's social media has grown into an active, informative educational channel that builds closer relationships with its followers.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cd-wrap">
      <div class="project-block reveal">
        <h3 data-i18n="p1_h2">Delivering Informative and Consistent Educational Content</h3>
        <div class="mp-thumb"><img role="button" tabindex="0" src="assets/img/img-6504d61ced62.webp" alt="Sosial Media Content — Wellner Academy" loading="lazy"></div>
        <p data-i18n="p1_desc">We manage the entire content production process for Wellner Academy's social media, from content planning, topic research, copywriting, and visual design, to publishing schedules. Every piece of content is designed to convey information on finance, taxation, accounting, and design in easy-to-understand language with engaging visuals, boosting engagement while strengthening Wellner Academy's positioning as a trusted education platform.</p>
        <div class="highlight-grid">
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p1_hl1">3-5 posts / week</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p1_hl2">5% engagement rate</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p1_hl3">Consistent, relevant educational content</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <h2 data-i18n="wf_label">Project Workflow</h2>
      <p data-i18n="wf_desc">We apply a structured workflow to ensure every piece of content is produced consistently, maintains strong visual quality, and stays aligned with the brand's communication strategy.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="wf-track reveal">
      <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="wf-connector" viewBox="0 0 1200 320" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <path d="M70,35 L600,35 L1130,35 C1200,35 1200,160 1130,160 L600,160 L70,160 C0,160 0,285 70,285 L600,285 L1130,285" stroke="rgba(21,23,27,.4)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="2 11" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="wf-grid">
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">01</span><h3 data-i18n="wf_1">Discovery</h3></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">02</span><h3 data-i18n="wf_2">Content Research</h3></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">03</span><h3 data-i18n="wf_3">Content Planning</h3></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">04</span><h3 data-i18n="wf_4">Copywriting</h3></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">05</span><h3 data-i18n="wf_5">Visual Design</h3></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">06</span><h3 data-i18n="wf_6">Content Review</h3></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">07</span><h3 data-i18n="wf_7">Publishing</h3></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">08</span><h3 data-i18n="wf_8">Monitoring</h3></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">09</span><h3 data-i18n="wf_9">Evaluation</h3></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <h2 data-i18n="tools_label">Tools &amp; Software</h2>
      <p data-i18n="tools_desc">For the Wellner Academy project, we use a range of professional software to support content production, campaign management, design, and AI-assisted workflows end-to-end.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tools-grid reveal">
      <div class="tools-cat">
        <h3 data-i18n="tools_cat1">Creative &amp; Design</h3>
        <div class="tools-icon-row">
          <div class="tool-item"><div class="tool-logo"><img src="assets/img/img-24ae85c4ad59.png" alt="Adobe Photoshop" loading="lazy"></div><span>Photoshop</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><div class="tool-logo"><img src="assets/img/img-31d06b608bbc.png" alt="Adobe Illustrator" loading="lazy"></div><span>Illustrator</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><div class="tool-logo"><img src="assets/img/img-3d6909954fce.png" alt="CapCut" loading="lazy"></div><span>CapCut</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tools-cat">
        <h3 data-i18n="tools_cat4">AI &amp; Productivity</h3>
        <div class="tools-icon-row">
          <div class="tool-item"><div class="tool-logo"><img src="assets/img/img-a077fd0cc438.png" alt="ChatGPT" loading="lazy"></div><span>ChatGPT</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><div class="tool-logo"><img src="assets/img/img-38a2ce323997.png" alt="Gemini" loading="lazy"></div><span>Gemini</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><div class="tool-logo"><img src="assets/img/img-d9168d6f790c.png" alt="Magnific AI" loading="lazy"></div><span>Magnific AI</span></div>
          <div class="tool-item"><div class="tool-logo"><img src="assets/img/img-fee42bc9b96c.png" alt="Envato Elements" loading="lazy"></div><span>Envato Elements</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cd-wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <h2 data-i18n="impact_label">Project Impact</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="impact_p1">Through a consistent Social Media Management strategy, Wellner Academy now has a more professional digital identity with structured, relevant content for its target audience.</p>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="impact_p2">Consistent publishing, strong visual quality, and clear delivery of educational material have helped strengthen brand credibility, boost audience interaction, and build a digital communication foundation that can keep growing alongside Wellner Academy.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 data-i18n="cta_h2">Want Similar Results for Your Business?</h2>
    <p data-i18n="cta_p">Let's discuss the digital marketing strategy that fits your brand &mdash; free initial consultation.</p>
    <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary wa-cta" data-wa-phone="6282289348724" data-i18n="cta_btn">Start a Project &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</section>


